{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人賈曉晨（JJ）跟武打明星樊少皇婚後育有兩女，包括大女「小飯兜」及細女「小飯團」，當中大女因樣貌標致而備受網民關注。</p><p>近日是大女的9歲生日，由於正日生日當天，樊少皇因工作關係未能一齊慶祝，昨日（21日）終於一家四口齊齊整整為小飯兜補祝生日，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T03:22:18.394127+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T03:01:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T03:15:37.278737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T03:15:37.278737+00:00","content_hash":"724f31a367f5f394858e1ff48e7674c47f4331c967b1c94110c0db69ab38a366","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}